    "html": "<p>A ball is kicked upwards at an angle to the horizontal with an initial kinetic energy of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"100\"></span> J and an initial momentum of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\"></span> kg m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>. Air resistance is negligible. What is a possible value for the total energy and for the momentum of the ball when it is at the highest point of its motion?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Total energy</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Momentum</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"100\"></span> J</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\"></span> kg m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"100\"></span> J</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"40\"></span> kg m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"80\"></span> J</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\"></span> kg m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"80\"></span> J</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"40\"></span> kg m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
